{"seq":2,"slug":"target-brand-lead-pool","title":"目标品牌与商家线索库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-planning-target/target-brand-lead-pool","wordCount":2067,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"目标品牌与商家线索库\">目标品牌与商家线索库</h1><p>缺口表告诉你「新加坡的电子配件品类缺优质供给，需要约 31 个商家」。接下来要回答的是一个完全不同的问题：<strong>这 31 个商家是谁？</strong> 平台内部没有他们的数据——他们还没入驻。线索库的意义就在于，把平台外部的、零散的信息（公开工商信息、竞品店铺、展会名录、行业报告、服务商推荐）收敛成一份<strong>结构统一、可打分、可分配给 BD</strong> 的名单。</p>\n<p>这份名单的质量直接决定 BD 的产能利用率。一个常见的失败模式是：BD 花两周拜访了清单上的 20 家，最后发现其中 14 家根本不做目标品类、3 家规模太小无法满足平台最低供货要求。问题不在 BD，在清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-线索库的字段模型\">核心概念：线索库的字段模型</h2><p>线索（lead）与入驻后的商家（merchant）是两个不同的实体，绝不能共用一张表。前者是<strong>未经核实的、来自外部的、可能重复的</strong>信息，后者必须通过 KYC 且唯一。把线索写成 merchant 草稿会造成大量脏数据回流。一份够用的线索模型至少需要四组字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE recruit_lead (&#10;  id              BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  -- 1. 身份与去重&#10;  legal_name      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  brand_name      TEXT,&#10;  external_ids    JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,  -- {shopee_shop_id, amazon_seller_id, tax_no}&#10;  dedup_key       TEXT NOT NULL,                 -- 归一化后的主键，见下文&#10;  -- 2. 定位&#10;  country_code    CHAR(2) NOT NULL,              -- ISO 3166-1 alpha-2&#10;  category_ids    TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  -- 3. 打分输入&#10;  fit_signals     JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  intent_signals  JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  score           NUMERIC(5,2),&#10;  score_updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  -- 4. 归属与状态&#10;  owner_bd_id     BIGINT REFERENCES bd_user(id),&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;new&#39;&#10;                  CHECK (status IN (&#39;new&#39;,&#39;qualified&#39;,&#39;converted&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;dormant&#39;)),&#10;  source_channel  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  source_ref      TEXT,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON recruit_lead (dedup_key);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON recruit_lead (owner_bd_id, status, score DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recruit_lead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 1. 身份与去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_name      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  brand_name      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_ids    JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {shopee_shop_id, amazon_seller_id, tax_no}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dedup_key       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归一化后的主键，见下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 2. 定位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ISO 3166-1 alpha-2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_ids    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 3. 打分输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fit_signals     JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intent_signals  JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score_updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 4. 归属与状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner_bd_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bd_user(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'qualified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'converted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dormant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_channel  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_lead (dedup_key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_lead (owner_bd_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>country_code</code> 用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-1\">ISO 3166-1 alpha-2</a> 而不是自建国家表，是为了与商品、物流、支付、税务各系统的区域标识直接对齐——自建国家代码是跨境系统里最典型的低级重复劳动。<code>external_ids</code> 用 JSONB 存放竞品店铺 ID 之类的稀疏外部标识，因为不同来源的标识集合差异很大，硬编码成列会导致大量 NULL 列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"去重键的设计\">去重键的设计</h3><p><code>dedup_key</code> 是线索库最容易出问题的地方。同一个品牌可能以「深圳市某某科技有限公司」「Shenzhen XX Tech」两种写法从三个渠道进来。可用的做法是把多个弱标识组合成一个可精确匹配的键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"dedup_key = lower(trim(regexp_replace(coalesce(brand_name, legal_name), &#39;\\s+&#39;, &#39;&#39;, &#39;g&#39;)))&#10;            || &#39;|&#39; || country_code\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dedup_key = lower(trim(regexp_replace(coalesce(brand_name, legal_name), '\\s+', '', 'g')))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            || '|' || country_code</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多条弱标识的取舍\">多条弱标识的取舍</h3><p>这个键不完美——它会把「Apple」在不同国家的同名小公司误判——所以实践中通常维护<strong>两条索引</strong>：一条强键（有税务号或竞品店铺 ID 时直接用），一条弱键（上面的字符串归一化），弱键命中时进人工确认队列而不是自动合并。<strong>自动合并的代价远高于漏合并</strong>：漏合并只是 BD 重复联系一次，误合并会让两个真实商家被压成一条，后续所有归属与绩效都会错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线索打分-显式与隐式信号\">线索打分：显式与隐式信号</h2><p>线索排序需要把异质的信号压成一个分数。行业里通用的做法是区分两类信号（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lead_scoring\">Lead scoring</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>显式 / firmographic</td>\n<td>公司规模、品类、国家、是否有品牌商标</td>\n<td>相对稳定、来源可靠、区分度低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐式 / behavioral</td>\n<td>竞品近期上新、参加行业展会、招聘跨境运营、官网新增国际站</td>\n<td>时效强、噪音大、区分度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>显式信号回答「像不像我们的目标客户」，隐式信号回答「<strong>现在</strong>是不是接触的好时机」。两条都很重要，但它们的<strong>衰减速度完全不同</strong>——这决定了打分模型必须有时间维度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"打分的乘法结构\">打分的乘法结构</h3><p>一个比加权求和更贴合招商场景的形式是「资格 × 时机」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fit</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>intent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = F_{\\text{fit}} \\times I_{\\text{intent}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fit</mtext></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{fit}} \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 由显式信号合成（品类匹配度、规模落在目标区间、国家在目标市场）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>intent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{intent}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是带时间衰减的意图强度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>intent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{intent}}(t) = \\sum_{e \\in E} w_e \\cdot 2^{-(t - t_e)/h_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个意图事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>（如竞品上新、参展）有基础权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（用天数）。<strong>半衰期参数是这套模型里唯一真正需要业务判断的地方</strong>：「参加了某展会」的半衰期可能是 30 天，因为展会后的决策窗口大概就是一个月；「在竞品开了新店」的半衰期可能长达 180 天，因为它反映的是一种持续的经营意愿。</p>\n<p>用乘法而非加法的好处是，一个资质极差但意图极强的商家不会因为意图分高而被推到榜首——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{fit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0 时整个分数就会被压住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[外部来源&lt;br/&gt;工商/竞品/展会/推荐] --&gt; B[归一化与去重&lt;br/&gt;dedup_key]&#10;  B --&gt; C{强键命中?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[并入已有线索]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[新建线索]&#10;  D --&gt; F[信号采集&lt;br/&gt;显式 fit + 隐式 intent]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[score = fit × intent/衰减/]&#10;  G --&gt; H{score 阈值}&#10;  H --&gt;|高| I[分配给目标区域 BD]&#10;  H --&gt;|中| J[进培育池 定期重算]&#10;  H --&gt;|低| K[归档 不占用 BD 产能]&#10;  I --&gt; L[进入招商 CRM 管道]\">graph TD\n  A[外部来源&lt;br/&gt;工商/竞品/展会/推荐] --&gt; B[归一化与去重&lt;br/&gt;dedup_key]\n  B --&gt; C{强键命中?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[并入已有线索]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[新建线索]\n  D --&gt; F[信号采集&lt;br/&gt;显式 fit + 隐式 intent]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[score = fit × intent/衰减/]\n  G --&gt; H{score 阈值}\n  H --&gt;|高| I[分配给目标区域 BD]\n  H --&gt;|中| J[进培育池 定期重算]\n  H --&gt;|低| K[归档 不占用 BD 产能]\n  I --&gt; L[进入招商 CRM 管道]</pre><p>图里最关键的一条边是 <code>H --&gt;|中| J</code>：<strong>大部分线索不应该被立刻分配</strong>。BD 的产能是稀缺资源，把中等分的线索硬塞给 BD 只会稀释他们对高分线索的投入。中等线索应当躺在培育池里，等新的意图事件把它推过阈值——这也是为什么 <code>score_updated_at</code> 与定期重算是必需的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"培育池的重算节奏\">培育池的重算节奏</h3><p>中等分线索躺在培育池里等新意图事件推它过阈值，这个机制要有一套明确的调度规则，否则培育池会变成新的静默流失点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;nurture_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;recompute_cron&quot;: &quot;0 3 * * *&quot;,&#10;    &quot;recompute_scope&quot;: &quot;status = &#39;dormant&#39; or &#39;new&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;promote_threshold_delta&quot;: 0.15,&#10;    &quot;max_nurture_days&quot;: 180,&#10;    &quot;on_expiry&quot;: &quot;archive_with_reason_code&quot;,&#10;    &quot;cap_promotions_per_bd_per_week&quot;: 10&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"nurture_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"recompute_cron\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0 3 * * *\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"recompute_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status = 'dormant' or 'new'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"promote_threshold_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_nurture_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_expiry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"archive_with_reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cap_promotions_per_bd_per_week\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>promote_threshold_delta: 0.15</code> 表示意图分需要比上次评估时<strong>上升至少 0.15</strong> 才触发升级，这是防止同一批线索每天都被重算成「刚好过线」而反复打扰 BD。<code>max_nurture_days: 180</code> 与 <code>cap_promotions_per_bd_per_week: 10</code> 共同控制了培育池的规模上限——超过半年的线索归档，每周每位 BD 最多接收 10 条升级线索，保证升级进来的线索确实能被跟进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"名单来源与准入\">名单来源与准入</h2><p>线索来源决定名单的整体风险与质量水位。跨境招商常见的来源及其特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>覆盖度</th>\n<th>信息真实度</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞品平台公开店铺</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>信息时效、合规边界</td>\n<td>走公开信息管线（见 1.3 篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工商/商标公开数据库</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>与经营实体对应关系</td>\n<td>强键直接入池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业展会名录</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>名片信息过时</td>\n<td>展会结束后 30 天内跟进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务商/代运营推荐</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>推荐方动机（拿返佣）</td>\n<td>需独立验证经营实质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>老商家推荐</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>覆盖有限</td>\n<td>优先跟进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络抓取邮箱后群发</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>法律风险极高</td>\n<td><strong>禁止</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行必须写死。基于公开网页抓取邮箱再群发招商邀约，在多个法域下同时触碰<strong>反垃圾邮件法</strong>（如澳大利亚 Spam Act 2003 对地址收割的限制）、<strong>数据保护法</strong>（法国 CNIL 明确指出「公开可得的数据仍然是个人数据」，未经数据主体知情不得改作他用），以及平台自身的反垃圾政策。这条边界在 <a href=\"competitor-merchant-intel\">竞品商家情报与迁移吸引</a> 中会进一步展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线索的生命周期与交接\">线索的生命周期与交接</h2><p>线索库不是终点，它是 <a href=\"../bd-pipeline-negotiation/lead-stage-crm-pipeline\">线索阶段管理（招商 CRM）</a> 的上游。两者之间需要一条明确的状态过渡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lead_status_transitions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;new&quot;: { &quot;to&quot;: [&quot;qualified&quot;, &quot;rejected&quot;], &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;dedup_done_and_score_computed&quot; },&#10;    &quot;qualified&quot;: { &quot;to&quot;: [&quot;converted&quot;, &quot;dormant&quot;, &quot;rejected&quot;], &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;assigned_to_bd_and_accepted&quot; },&#10;    &quot;converted&quot;: { &quot;to&quot;: [], &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;pipeline_opportunity_created&quot; },&#10;    &quot;dormant&quot;: { &quot;to&quot;: [&quot;qualified&quot;], &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;new_intent_event_above_threshold&quot; },&#10;    &quot;rejected&quot;: { &quot;to&quot;: [], &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;terminal&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;assignment_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;by&quot;: &quot;country_code_to_territory_then_round_robin&quot;,&#10;    &quot;max_active_leads_per_bd&quot;: 60,&#10;    &quot;reassign_on_inactivity_days&quot;: 21&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lead_status_transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"qualified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dedup_done_and_score_computed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"qualified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"converted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dormant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assigned_to_bd_and_accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"converted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pipeline_opportunity_created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dormant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"qualified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new_intent_event_above_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assignment_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"country_code_to_territory_then_round_robin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_active_leads_per_bd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reassign_on_inactivity_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_active_leads_per_bd</code> 与 <code>reassign_on_inactivity_days</code> 是防止线索库变成「公海垃圾场」的两个闸门。没有前者，BD 会屯积线索（先占住再说）；没有后者，线索会永久卡在一个不跟进的 BD 名下，等于从名单里消失。<strong><code>converted</code> 是终态</strong>——线索一旦转成商机，它的后续状态由管道负责，线索库不再干预，避免两侧状态互相覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线索是未经核实的外部信息，不能与 KYC 后的 merchant 共用表；四组字段（身份去重、定位、打分输入、归属状态）是最小可用集。</li>\n<li>去重键用「强键 + 弱键」双层策略，弱键命中进人工确认队列；自动合并比漏合并代价高得多。</li>\n<li>打分用「资格 × 时机」的乘法结构，意图项带半衰期衰减，半衰期参数是唯一需要业务判断的地方。</li>\n<li>中等分线索进培育池而非立刻分配，BD 产能要留给高分线索。</li>\n<li>来源准入必须显式拒绝「抓取邮箱群发」这一类，它同时违反多部法律与平台政策。</li>\n<li>线索库与 CRM 之间要有明确的状态过渡与按区分配策略，防止线索被屯积或永久卡死。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"competitor-merchant-intel\">竞品商家情报与迁移吸引</a> 深入线索来源中最有价值也最敏感的一类：竞品商家。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目标品牌与商家线索库","id":"目标品牌与商家线索库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：线索库的字段模型","id":"核心概念-线索库的字段模型"},{"level":3,"text":"去重键的设计","id":"去重键的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"多条弱标识的取舍","id":"多条弱标识的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"线索打分：显式与隐式信号","id":"线索打分-显式与隐式信号"},{"level":3,"text":"打分的乘法结构","id":"打分的乘法结构"},{"level":3,"text":"培育池的重算节奏","id":"培育池的重算节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"名单来源与准入","id":"名单来源与准入"},{"level":2,"text":"线索的生命周期与交接","id":"线索的生命周期与交接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"品类/区域招商规划与缺口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-planning-target/category-region-recruit-plan"},"next":{"title":"竞品商家情报与迁移吸引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-planning-target/competitor-merchant-intel"}}